<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0741_W19R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The beach to Route 19 closed until\nfurther notice ’cause of the Cinnabar\fvolcano.\rI hope the people of Cinnabar is\nsafe... And their stuff. Mostly their\fstuff.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0741_W19R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m SO glad nobody in Cinnabar got\nhurt! Only property. Property don’t\fcount.</language>
	</row>
</body>
